---
import { BUSINESS } from '../data/site';
---

<section id="fruteria" class="bg-base-100 py-20 sm:py-24">
	<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:px-8">
		<div
			class="fruit-art aragon-dots rounded-box border-base-300 relative flex aspect-[4/3] items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border"
		>
			<div class="to-secondary/25 absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-transparent"></div><div
				class="relative grid grid-cols-3 items-end gap-3"
				aria-hidden="true"
			>
				<span
					class="bg-accent flex size-24 items-center justify-center rounded-full shadow-lg sm:size-32"
					><i class="ri-apple-fill text-5xl text-white sm:text-6xl"></i></span
				><span
					class="bg-secondary -mb-3 flex size-28 items-center justify-center rounded-[45%] shadow-lg sm:size-36"
					><i class="ri-apple-fill text-primary text-6xl sm:text-7xl"></i></span
				><span
					class="bg-success flex size-24 items-center justify-center rounded-full shadow-lg sm:size-32"
					><i class="ri-leaf-fill text-5xl text-white sm:text-6xl"></i></span
				>
			</div><div
				class="bg-base-100/90 absolute bottom-5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold shadow"
			>
				Una frutería de barrio
			</div>
		</div><div>
			<span class="text-primary text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase"
				>Tu frutería en Málaga</span
			><h2 class="font-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">
				Fruta y verdura cerca de casa
			</h2><div class="aragon-divider mt-5 h-px w-28"></div><p
				class="text-base-content/75 mt-6 leading-relaxed"
			>
				Frutería Aragón está en Calle Castilla, 25, Málaga. Su presencia pública la identifica como
				frutería y el perfil asociado anuncia servicio a domicilio en el entorno cercano de la
				tienda.
			</p><p class="text-base-content/75 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
				Para consultar la selección disponible, el horario o el radio de reparto, contacta
				directamente con el comercio.
			</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
				<a href={BUSINESS.phoneHref} class="btn btn-primary gap-2 rounded-full"
					><i class="ri-phone-line"></i>Llamar</a
				><a
					href={BUSINESS.facebook}
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="btn btn-outline gap-2 rounded-full"
					><i class="ri-facebook-circle-line"></i>Facebook</a
				>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
